  "source": "# The storeroom\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/scene-dark-room.md`, then edited by it: without its grid\n  (`game-storeroom-nogrid.md`), the round of the castle painted\n  (`game-storeroom-voids.md`), the hole in the floor (`game-storeroom-hole.md`).\n- Its base is Gemini's edit without the door (`storeroom-base.md`); the door open is its\n  edit of the base (`storeroom-open.md`), and each leaf the difference (D148). So is the\n  door's arch, from `storeroom-gone.md`; the arch where the corridor comes in and the two\n  torches by the door, from the edits in which Gemini painted them flat magenta\n  (`storeroom-arch-torches-marked.md`, and `storeroom-torches-marked.md` for the\n  torches' flames).\n",
